# <type>(<scope>): <subject>
# 
# <body>
#
# <footer>
#
# Types:
#   feat:     A new feature
#   fix:      A bug fix
#   refactor: Code refactoring
#   perf:     Performance improvement
#   docs:     Documentation
#   test:     Test additions or changes
#   style:    Code style changes (semicolons, commas, etc)
#   chore:    Dependencies and configuration
#
# Scopes for CityMapStudio:
#   - ui:         WPF UI components
#   - viewport:   3D viewport and rendering
#   - camera:     Camera controller
#   - mesh:       Terrain/Water mesh generation
#   - water:      Water-related features
#   - terrainMesh: Terrain mesh generation
#   - lod:        Level of Detail system
#   - material:   Material and shading
#   - export:     Export functionality
#   - import:     Import functionality
#   - domain:     Domain models
#   - app:        Application logic
#   - infra:      Infrastructure/IO
#   - perf:       Performance optimization
#   - tests:      Unit/Integration tests
#   - ci:         CI/CD configuration
#   - docs:       Documentation
#
# Example:
#   feat(water): add water transparency to rendering
#   fix(camera): correct Z-axis positioning for frontal view
#   perf(mesh): optimize normal calculation in TerrainMeshGenerator
